The ComfyUI integration and local worker protocol are adapted from this
project's earlier ComfyUI-KohakuMOSS-Trainer integration.

Inference is executed through the public MossPipeline API of a separately
installed KohakuMossTrainer checkout. This repository does not vendor the
trainer, model weights, GPU kernels, or ComfyUI-MOSS-Precompile source.

